WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.980
A mysterious substance that causes rapid Zonderization...

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.070
...by implanting itself into a human host.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:16.660
So little is known about its structure, so many questions are unanswered...

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.960
I can see it's formed by crystallization and complex heavy atom binding.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.710
It's practically a life-form in itself.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.590
Yes, like a virus.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:42.810
The Zonders expand by fusing with machines and absorbing energy.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:58.070
So far, we've successfully Purified each Zonder before it fully developed.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.830
But I don't understand, by infecting humans with Zonder Metal and...

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.370
...using them as catalysts, what do they hope to achieve?

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:14.220
If a Zonder was allowed to reach full maturation, what would happen?

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.880
What does the computer predict?

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.050
The dispersal of Elementary Particle Z0...

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.810
It'll spread Elementary Particle Z0 over the entire world?

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:38.070
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:42.080
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:48.800
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.080
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:58.000
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.920
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.720
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.480
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.650
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.190
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.320
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:25.280
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:29.360
Dividing Driver!

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:37.000
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:42.880
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.830
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:49.720
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.690
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.690
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:57.150
The Gates of Isolde

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.990
<i>The Gates of Isolde</i>

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.710
Oh, my, it's gigantic!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.170
So is this, um...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.290
That's right!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.880
A massive particle accelerator, 20 km in diameter...

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:19.760
Isolde...

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.680
In this facility, scientists propel charged particles to high speeds...

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.720
...and cause them to collide.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.980
Built in the Tomakomai region of Hokkaido, it is a massive particle...

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:34.980
...accelerator modeled after the Tevatron, the world's largest!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.070
Oh! Such an enormous scale!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.910
Now confirming the arrival of Dr. Shishioh and Ms. White.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.170
Welcome to Isolde!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.840
Dr. Shishioh...

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:05.970
Well, I had to come see you achieve your longstanding goal, Nozaki!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.930
Nice to meet you, Professor Nozaki.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.270
My name is Swan White.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.900
Ms. White is my brilliant assistant!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:22.780
I am Nozaki, in charge of designing Isolde and conducting experiments.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.700
Isolde is capable of emitting more than 20 tera-electronvolts.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:33.620
Clearly, Isolde is the highest energy particle collider in the world!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:38.040
But Nozaki, high energy isn't the only important factor in experiments.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.470
Accurate measuring, phase- stabilization, beam convergence...

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.890
Is all that power really necessary, I wonder?

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.390
Doctor, Ms. White...

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.230
We'll be arriving at the Underground Chamber very soon.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.560
Oh! Wow!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.530
This is the most powerful particle beam generator in the world.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:15.250
We produce the protons and anti- protons and this is where they collide!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.710
Now then, why don't I demonstrate the true value of Isolde to you...

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.190
The Gates of Isolde?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:42.110
That's right, it's an old, old village legend of Four Gates that lead to Hell!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.780
And if anyone should open those gates...

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.990
...horror of horrors...

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:54.160
...it's the most dreadful thing you can imagine!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.250
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.920
Simply marvelous...

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.180
Never before has a particle reaction of...

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.350
...such high energy been induced anywhere on Earth...

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.190
But a reaction so massive, wouldn't it be that much harder to measure?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:23.860
Look at this.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.450
The particle beams produced by Isolde can penetrate...

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.110
...the thickest steel plate as if it were a flimsy sheet of paper.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.990
That's right, even those battle machines of yours at GGG...

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.700
...wouldn't last 2 seconds against it!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.620
Nozaki!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.550
Professor, you must forgive me.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.470
I've just been summoned to the Main Control Room.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:54.140
Please feel free to look around the premises while I'm gone...

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.850
Later, then...

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.820
Such a weak-willed man...

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.240
Lord Pasdar...

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.200
Thanks to the power you granted me...

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.580
The Zonder power, that is...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:19.910
Isolde is now more powerful than anything else on earth!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:25.250
The Zonder Metal Plant is on track to complete its mission.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.170
I am using the energy produced by Isolde...

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:33.390
...to create massive amounts of Zonder metal!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:39.020
That black robot is certain to appear again.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.940
Please rest assured, Lord Pasdar.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:46.980
Here on Earth, we always eradicate any parasite that attacks our fields.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.780
This very Underground Chamber shall serve as their final resting place!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.580
Professor!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.880
Whoever dares open the Gates of Isolde...

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.840
...is sure to die a horrible death!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.550
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.640
Huh? An emergency alert from Volfogg?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.390
This isn't good!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.810
The professor and Swan...

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:28.980
Zonder!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.090
Tomakomai, huh?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:53.220
That's really far away, no wonder I can't sense it that strongly.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.760
Hey...

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.140
...you used to live in Hokkaido not too long ago, right?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:02.060
Yeah, we moved to G Island City when I was around 5...

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.900
Just be safe, Dad, Swan...

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:33.260
Hey, I think this is close to where Hana's grandmother lives...

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.630
Mamoru, are you sensing that Zonder?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:36.800
Yeah...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.890
...but I'm not really sure about this.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.550
It feels different than the other times.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.470
Can you tell if it's on the move?

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.480
Well, no, not right now, at least.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.810
Gai here. I'm in front of Isolde's north gate.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.730
Major, the air's charged. It seems to be ionizing!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.650
I can smell ozone all over the Northern Slope.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.080
The particle accelerator's electro- magnetic field must be out of control!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.000
I'll bet that once we infiltrate Isolde, we'll lose all contact.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.170
HyoRyu and EnRyu, you're going to stick to the plan...

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.960
...and divert the enemy at the East and West gates.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:11.960
Roger!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.340
All right, let's start the invasion!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:35.780
The Gates of Isolde must never be opened!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.580
You gotta be kidding!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.450
We've lost the signal already!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.370
Hey, who's that by the South gate?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:31.500
Well, now! So the intruder turned out to be nothing but an ugly toy!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.290
How dare you!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:38.380
Do you really believe a plaything like you can hope to capture me?

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:40.050
Hey, just a minute, you!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.550
Now, then, come this way...

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.300
To the Hell that awaits you at the bottom of the Earth!

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.150
Ah, how kind of you to drop by...

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.280
An organic reading?

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.990
Yet I'm also picking up an equally strong electromagnetic reading!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.820
Are you a life-form, or are you a robot?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.950
I am neither one nor the other, good sir!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:13.870
Perhaps it would be best to call me a sophisticated human-machine hybrid.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.550
Not that it really matters, since it's well beyond the reach...

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.680
...of a worthless piece of man-made junk like yourself to analyze me!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.340
You're not human?

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.140
So does that make you a Zonder?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.310
No, you must be an alien!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.180
A Zonderian?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.940
Indeed, sir.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:37.690
You may call me Pizza, one of the Four Machine Kings!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.820
As of now, this place belongs to us.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.490
All intruders will be eliminated!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.030
I'd like to see you try it!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.330
Come, come now! Cyborg...

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.410
Surely that's not the best you can do!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.210
I see you're powerless unless you fuse yourself with that black robot...

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.170
I don't have to transform into GaoGaiGar just to take you out!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.050
How amusing...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.900
Hyper Mode!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:22.690
By entering Hyper Mode, it's possible for Cyborg Gai to push...

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:28.030
...his fighting abilities as a cyborg to the limit for three minutes!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.080
What the...

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.370
Hey, I was just faking you out before!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.170
Will Knife!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.420
Such speed!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:52.890
Not too shabby, cyborg...

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:54.560
Come back here!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.150
Hyper Mode timed out, huh?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.780
Shoot, I'm not going to let you get away!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.200
Galeon!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.100
Who are you?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.540
What the heck is this?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.160
The whole Control Room's been Zonderized!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.870
Captain!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.210
Thank goodness you're safe, Captain!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.630
Same goes for you two!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.800
I was chasing the enemy and ended up here!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:12.470
Actually, it seemed as though the enemy was luring me here.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:13.640
Don't tell me...

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.770
Allow me to show you my Isolde's true power!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.370
Zonder!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.250
What in God's name is going on out there?

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.690
What a delight to behold!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.810
Defeat those wretches and cultivate...

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:08.070
...massive amounts of Zonder Metal, here in this Underground Chamber.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:12.530
Lord Pasdar's strategy is as impeccable as always!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.580
It's too early to rest on our laurels...

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.120
Well, now, Penchinon!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.250
There's more than just three of them, you know...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.550
Volfogg!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.930
Please forgive me for not coming to your rescue sooner.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.810
The Mobile Unit is creating a diversion as we speak...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.900
This is your only chance to escape!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.070
If we're exposed to these electro- magnetic waves much longer...

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.950
...our A.I. will be initialized!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.790
And some of those memories, I'd rather not reset!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.470
Sorry to cause so much worry, everybody!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.970
Swan!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.430
Right on!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:26.100
Those humans were supposed to be our next Zonder hosts...

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.310
How could we let them get away?

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.280
No robot could possibly move about freely surrounded...

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.690
...by those electromagnetic waves!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.990
I'm sure it's nothing more than an ugly piece of junk!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.870
No, that particular robot is a bit different than the rest...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.080
Hey, you made it!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.140
The electromagnetic waves are gone!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.020
Rest assured, GaiGar, all those held captive have escaped!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.440
I owe you one, Volfogg!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.060
All right, then...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.770
GaoMachines!

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.870
Final Fusion!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:04.990
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.910
Zonder!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.840
Volfogg!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.930
Those are proton and anti-proton beam lines...

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.260
...supercharged with the power of Isolde.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.180
We'll be buried alive if it attacks us now!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.270
Protect Shade!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.780
Locking down coordinates!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.950
Rate of success, 80.1%!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.870
In theory, it would be best to aim for that hole.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:52.870
All right!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.210
Dividing Driver, launch!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.600
Power Ladder!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.270
That's it, HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.230
Captain! Take this, if you please!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.740
Dividing Driver!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.090
GaoGaiGar!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.920
HyoRyu, EnRyu...

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.510
No!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.820
Where's that core?

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.650
There it is!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.330
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.680
No! My precious Zonder Plant's destroyed...

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.730
GaoGaiGar, I'll be sure to remember that name!

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.400
The Gates of Isolde...

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.870
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.410
Grandma! Hana, dear!

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.700
Dinner's on the table!

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:55.870
Okay!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.170
Coming!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:58.580
Looks delicious!

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.050
Grandma, tell me some more scary stories after dinner, okay?

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.260
Yes, of course, dear...

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.890
Coctura!

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:19.520
I never expected them to use Nozaki, a scientist...

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:23.980
...whose only focus was creating energy with that particle accelerator.

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:25.570
Professor...

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:29.360
I've collected a very intriguing sample from that Underground Chamber...

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.120
Ah! Volfogg, so you made it back safely.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:32.910
Professor...

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.870
But that's...

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:40.210
Zonder Metal!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:48.990
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:53.820
The Zonder metal brought back from Isolde bears a terrifying secret!

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:57.540
The enemy Zonderians are about to launch a campaign to annihilate GGG.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.290
GaoGaiGar versus ChoRyuJin...

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.370
Who shall claim victory?

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:05.170
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:06.590
"Tomorrow"

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:10.510
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:10.470
Tomorrow

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
GaoGaiGar with
StealthGao, DrillGao

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:15.010
This is the Key to Victory!
